[00:00.69] Broke my heart on Saturday
[00:00.69]周六那天 你伤透我心
[00:03.90] Guess overnight, your feelings changed
[00:03.90]想必是一夜之间 你的爱意竟荡然无存
[00:08.04] And I have cried so much I almost fainted (Aha, aha)
[00:08.04]我哭得撕心裂肺 差点就此昏厥 (Aha, aha)
[00:15.94] To show you just how much it hurts
[00:15.94]为让你看清 这份痛楚有多么刻骨铭心
[00:19.42] I wish I had a gun or words
